cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite this repository as a versioned conceptual problem statement and threat-model proposal. It is not peer reviewed and reports no empirical demonstration."
title: "Weight-Space Contagion: A Problem Statement and Threat Model for Conditional Behavior Transfer and Generational Reproduction"
type: other
authors:
  - name: "tornadofay"
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: 2026-11-04
abstract: >-
  A conceptual problem statement describing a hypothetical donor-guided
  transfer of condition-dependent behavior into a distinct recipient model's
  own parameters. It separates one-generation implantation from generational
  parameter-space transmission and distinguishes model-weight changes from
  prompts, adapters, external memory, and harness modifications. No experiments
  or empirical demonstrations are reported.
